      "source": "https://www.cityofkendrick.com/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "For thousands of years, the river terrace on the west bank of the Willamette River, below Oswego Creek, was home to Native Americans.",
